{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vicious Red unfolds on a sprawling space station in a near alternative past. After losing the moon race, the Soviet Union makes a fateful decision to focus on developing space shuttle technology. Thanks to engineering breakthroughs, they manage to build ships capable of delivering humans to another planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a disaster of unknown origin has struck an alien space station, transforming nearly all of its inhabitants into hostile mutants. You step into the role of an engineer, arriving during a new wave of colonization. To survive, you must uncover the truth behind the outbreak and deal with its terrifying aftermath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313380/extras/8baa4854183d19b46d143b2d4dcc55a4.poster.avif?t=1767808288\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313380/extras/8baa4854183d19b46d143b2d4dcc55a4.webm?t=1767808288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313380/extras/8baa4854183d19b46d143b2d4dcc55a4.mp4?t=1767808288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will feature Soviet brutalism, constructivism, and Soviet space futurism as its primary styles and aesthetics. Puzzles are based on pseudo-scientific realistic engineering, mechanical, chemical, or electrical tasks, designed to feel like real challenges on a space station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313380/extras/987243a5af026a231c2f2e480f1131b7.poster.avif?t=1767808288\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313380/extras/987243a5af026a231c2f2e480f1131b7.webm?t=1767808288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313380/extras/987243a5af026a231c2f2e480f1131b7.mp4?t=1767808288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vicious Red is a third-person survival horror game that stays true to the genre's best traditions. Enemies will haunt your every step, and survival here depends on you... Looking for a realistic horror experience? Welcome to Vicious Red!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2313380?t=1767808288","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2313380?t=1767808288","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313380/1d8ae4e5e19e9b7a6342545743ce909a23d6a1cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767808288","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313380/1d8ae4e5e19e9b7a6342545743ce909a23d6a1cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767808288","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vicious Red unfolds on a sprawling space station in a near alternative past. After losing the moon race, the Soviet Union makes a fateful decision to focus on developing space shuttle technology. Thanks to engineering breakthroughs, they manage to build ships capable of delivering humans to another planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a disaster of unknown origin has struck an alien space station, transforming nearly all of its inhabitants into hostile mutants. You step into the role of an engineer, arriving during a new wave of colonization. To survive, you must uncover the truth behind the outbreak and deal with its terrifying aftermath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313380/extras/8baa4854183d19b46d143b2d4dcc55a4.poster.avif?t=1767808288\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313380/extras/8baa4854183d19b46d143b2d4dcc55a4.webm?t=1767808288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313380/extras/8baa4854183d19b46d143b2d4dcc55a4.mp4?t=1767808288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will feature Soviet brutalism, constructivism, and Soviet space futurism as its primary styles and aesthetics. Puzzles are based on pseudo-scientific realistic engineering, mechanical, chemical, or electrical tasks, designed to feel like real challenges on a space station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313380/extras/987243a5af026a231c2f2e480f1131b7.poster.avif?t=1767808288\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313380/extras/987243a5af026a231c2f2e480f1131b7.webm?t=1767808288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313380/extras/987243a5af026a231c2f2e480f1131b7.mp4?t=1767808288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vicious Red is a third-person survival horror game that stays true to the genre's best traditions. Enemies will haunt your every step, and survival here depends on you... Looking for a realistic horror experience? Welcome to Vicious Red!</p>","developers":["HORNS AND HOOVES STUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313380/9c93aa4f18aee3594fdb7fb0dc80fc6cc11700bd/header.jpg?t=1767808288","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2313380/658850/b54c93c0dbdcde6fc4ebaa37142caca079626b59/1750905356/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744290589","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2313380/658850/b54c93c0dbdcde6fc4ebaa37142caca079626b59/1750905356/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744290589","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2313380/658850/b54c93c0dbdcde6fc4ebaa37142caca079626b59/1750905356/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744290589","id":256998964,"name":"Vicious Red Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256998964/45f44784abc399d9186eacfc5bee085553f400f2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744290589"}],"name":"Vicious Red","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window 10 64-bit +<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 2600x, Core i5 8600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RX 5700, GTX 1660TI<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 50GB SATA SSD</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window 10 64-bit +<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5600X, Core i5 11600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon RX 6700 XT, Geforce RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Sto